      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2871b077a42f39d05497830b1f5b04280359a2084e7544c3daa5c05e74c86585",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "觅食甚难，晚同王华祝，张仲苏及二弟住义兴局，觅齐寿山，得一餐。”",
      "output_sha256": "c281db0cb3faef24b725c76779d76d596bbfa5d231152938b80742ff25bab03a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "c281db0cb3faef24b725c76779d76d596bbfa5d231152938b80742ff25bab03a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "至十四日，我们便从新华饭店搬回会馆。",
      "output_sha256": "e3365e0d25aa360a70e91df2153bc878b7491b20dbbc707e61a5adc09ff1ff65",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.663235,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "73f10d1d25c8875315b818176e88dc467f80ab3f55bec319601f9c5539bd1380"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e3365e0d25aa360a70e91df2153bc878b7491b20dbbc707e61a5adc09ff1ff65",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那一天里枪炮声很是猛烈，足足放了十小时，但很奇怪的是，死伤却是意外的稀少，谣言传闻说都是朝天放的，死的若干人可能都是由于流弹。",
      "output_sha256": "471337d909511b502df878c397e4674994c32efa37c055f16e0449dea56e9649",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "471337d909511b502df878c397e4674994c32efa37c055f16e0449dea56e9649",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "东安门三座门在未拆除之前，还留下一点战迹，在它的西面有些弹痕，乃是从南河沿的张公馆向着东南打过来的。",
      "output_sha256": "79d76c8f368ed97edd5bed26bc12ca7a2e3296d39de07310acb5af16b39904e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "79d76c8f368ed97edd5bed26bc12ca7a2e3296d39de07310acb5af16b39904e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "烧残的张公馆首先毁去，东安门近年也已拆去，于是这复辟一役的遗迹就什么都已看不到了。",
      "output_sha256": "94d053532f22e0c1c3c5de2c4d24fec23aa5498e3ae0a8b9d2d9b5437b433131",
